div.p:
1. Whereas the Germans, during their occupation
                    of Roumania, issued paper money to a value exceeding 2½ milliards, on the form
                    of notes of the Banca Generala Romana;

And whereas furthermore, according to their
                    ledgers a reserve of such printed notes to the value of 111 millions was held in
                    Berlin;

And whereas this recommendation referred to the
                    dispatch, to Vienna and Budapest, of an Inter-Allied Commission for the purpose
                    of ensuring the execution thereof;
